.TH MISSIONPLANNER 1 "August 2026" "Mission Planner" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
missionplanner \- ground control station for ArduPilot vehicles
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B missionplanner
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Mission Planner is a native cross-platform Avalonia port of Mission Planner for flight
planning, telemetry, parameter management, log analysis, simulation, and vehicle
setup.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/MissionPlanner
User configuration.
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/MissionPlanner
Logs and persistent user data.
.TP
.I ~/.cache/MissionPlanner
Downloaded terrain, SITL, parameter, and update caches.
.SH SEE ALSO
.UR https://github.com/Rouniy/MissionPlanner
Project home page
.UE
